OL,3,GNEWSACottage cordoned off after
OL,4,A'unexplained' death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cottage in a village in
OL,7,FNottinghamshire has been sealed off
OL,8,Fafter a man's body was discovered
OL,9,Finside.
OL,11,FPolice said they were called to an
OL,12,Faddress in Lambley Lane, Burton Joyce,
OL,13,Fat 19:24 BST on Wednesday.
OL,15,FOfficers confirmed they were treating
OL,16,Fthe death as unexplained, but
OL,17,Femphasised it was an isolated incident
OL,18,Fand there was no risk to the wider
OL,19,Fpublic.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
